-- title:
--   Embedding dimensions in a surjection onto a regular local ring
-- statement:
--   Let $P$ be a commutative Noetherian local ring and let $S$ be a commutative ring that is a regular local ring, and let $f \colon P \to S$ be a surjective ring homomorphism. The assertion is the equality of natural numbers
--   $$\mu(\ker f) + \dim_{\kappa(S)} \mathrm{Cot}(S) = \dim_{\kappa(P)} \mathrm{Cot}(P),$$
--   where: $\mu(\ker f)$ is `Submodule.spanFinrank` of the kernel ideal of $f$, that is, the least cardinality of a generating set of $\ker f$ as a $P$-module (a natural number, the minimal number of generators, which is well defined since $P$ is Noetherian); $\mathrm{Cot}(R)$ denotes `IsLocalRing.CotangentSpace R`, the cotangent space $\mathfrak m_R/\mathfrak m_R^2$ of a local ring $R$ viewed as a vector space over the residue field $\kappa(R) =$ `IsLocalRing.ResidueField R`; and the two dimensions are the `Module.finrank` of these vector spaces, i.e. the embedding dimensions of $S$ and of $P$. No regularity is assumed of the source $P$, only that it is Noetherian and local.
--
--   This is the complete-intersection count for a presentation of a regular local ring: the kernel of a surjection from a Noetherian local ring onto a regular local ring is minimally generated by exactly the drop in embedding dimension. It is used in the criterion [`AlgebraicGeometry.SmoothOfRelativeDimension.of_forall_isRegularLocalRing_of_isAlgClosed`](thm.html#AlgebraicGeometry.SmoothOfRelativeDimension.of_forall_isRegularLocalRing_of_isAlgClosed), which recognises smoothness of a morphism of relative dimension from regularity of the local rings of its fibres over an algebraically closed field, and its proof invokes the fact that a regular local ring is a domain ([`IsRegularLocalRing.isDomain`](thm.html#IsRegularLocalRing.isDomain)).
-- source:
--   https://github.com/anthropics/fermats-last-theorem/blob/aa2d8b34692b16c70f699536de0d8e75b9a3e9ef/Theorems/Thm_IsRegularLocalRing_spanFinrank_ker_add_finrank_cotangentSpace.lean

import Mathlib

set_option maxHeartbeats 4000000
set_option synthInstance.maxHeartbeats 400000
set_option backward.isDefEq.respectTransparency.types false

universe u v

open IsLocalRing

theorem IsRegularLocalRing.spanFinrank_ker_add_finrank_cotangentSpace {P : Type u} {S : Type v}
    [CommRing P] [IsLocalRing P] [IsNoetherianRing P] [CommRing S] [IsRegularLocalRing S]
    (f : P →+* S) (hf : Function.Surjective f) :
    (RingHom.ker f).spanFinrank + Module.finrank (ResidueField S) (CotangentSpace S) =
      Module.finrank (ResidueField P) (CotangentSpace P) := by sorry
